    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38499" root="مرط" body-key="m">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امترطهُ</span></b>  <i>He seized it, took it hastily,</i> or
<i>snatched it unawares,</i> (K, TA,) from his hand:
(TA:) or <i>he collected it together,</i> (K, TA,)
namely, a thing that he had found; as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مرّطهُ</span></b> . (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِمَّرَطَ</span> [said in the K to be of
the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افتعل</span>]: see 5, in two places.

